---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /en/contact.html
lang: en
active: contacto
title: Contact | Hotel Playa de Aguilar ****
description: Phone, email, WhatsApp and location of Hotel Playa de Aguilar in Muros de Nalón, Asturias.
canonicalPath: /en/contact.html
altEs: /contacto.html
altEn: /en/contact.html
---
<section class="hero short">
  <div class="hero-bg" style="background-image:url('/assets/img/hero-2.jpg')"></div>
  <div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Contact</div><h1>Let's talk</h1></div>
</section>
<section>
  <div class="wrap contact-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>We're here to help</h2><p>We'll answer any question about your booking, the restaurant or the surroundings.</p></div>
      <div class="contact-list" style="margin-top:28px">
        <div class="contact-item"><span class="ico">☎</span><div><h3>Phone</h3><a href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}">+34 {{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a></div></div>
        <div class="contact-item"><span class="ico">✉</span><div><h3>Email</h3><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></div></div>
        <div class="contact-item"><span class="ico">💬</span><div><h3>WhatsApp</h3><a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Message us on WhatsApp</a></div></div>
        <div class="contact-item"><span class="ico">⚑</span><div><h3>Address</h3><p>{{ site.addressStreet }}, {{ site.addressPostal }}<br>{{ site.addressLocality }}, {{ site.addressRegion }}, Spain</p></div></div>
        <div class="contact-item"><span class="ico">⏰</span><div><h3>Reception</h3><p>{{ site.hoursEn }}</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:28px"><a class="btn" href="{{ site.bookingEn }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book online</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="map reveal"><iframe title="Map Hotel Playa de Aguilar" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Hotel+Playa+de+Aguilar+Muros+de+Nal%C3%B3n+Asturias&output=embed"></iframe></div>
  </div>
</section>
